{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51782","headline":"阳朔道中 · 石仲元","name":"阳朔道中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平原翠削万琼瑰，顿辔尘沙眼暂开。\n文网牵人宁底急，未妨得意看山来。\n（《全五代诗》六一）（〖1〗《古今图书集成·职方典》卷一四○六《桂林府部》收此诗，题作《寿阳山》，第二句「暂」作「渐」，第四句「得意」作「特特」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"石仲元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}